<title>JAPAN: Advantest shares up on forecast of higher profits.</title>
<headline>Advantest shares up on forecast of higher profits.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Advantest Corp rose on Monday morning, prompted by a newspaper report that the company is likely to post record profits in the current business year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The producer of measuring instruments ended the morning session up 50 yen at 6,100 yen by 0151 GMT with 455,600 shares traded.</p>
